Rich textured artwork of deep red woven fabric (#C8372D darkening to burgundy) with elegant cream (#F4EDE0) geometric cross-stitch rosettes and diamond borders framing the lower half and side edges. Warm velvety lighting glows softly from below, with subtle thread relief and gentle depth shading. The upper 30% remains a calm solid deep red for text overlay. 8K quality, ultra smooth gradients, premium feel, no text, no letters, no UI elements, no device mockups